{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因舉欽山問德山機緣，大愚芝云：欽山只顧其前，不顧其後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐佐切，下同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今收九首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和虎丘東州和尚韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
